# Line endings: Go sources and bash scripts must stay LF on every checkout.
# Without this, a Windows checkout converts LF -> CRLF (Git for Windows
# autocrlf default) and `gofmt -l` flags EVERY Go file as unformatted,
# because gofmt output uses LF. Proven 2026-10-26: CI run #2 failed the
# gofmt step on windows-latest while ubuntu-latest passed on identical
# content, and a CRLF copy of a clean file is listed by gofmt -l locally.
*.go text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
